Issue 708 runtime orientation A2A envelope regression proof

Finding fixed:
Provider-backed agent-to-agent conversation dispatch failed when the full orientation package was placed into the 4 KiB bounded user input field.

Fix summary:
The Runtime now passes the agent orientation package as a separate internal task field for provider-backed agent_runtime dispatch. The agent adapter keeps the original 4 KiB bound on operator/agent message input, validates a bounded internal orientation envelope separately, and prepends the orientation before the model-facing provider prompt content.

